{"title":"속이는 사랑","artist":"tuki","sourceId":"reference:0gQqLkyertrd0MWX9zEX","sourceHash":"3a825a339d9c8a2a0af426379cbe6c7d8092bca6e00cb382dd69c11fa0fe4298","performanceStatus":"no_performance_record","timingMethod":"reference_lrc_unverified","reviewStatus":"draft","cue_timing_confirmed":false,"timingWarning":"(주의) 노래와 함께 타이밍 검증되지 않았음","cues":[{"id":"1","start":0.98,"end":3.98,"text":"騙し合いのこの世界で","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"2","start":6.2,"end":9.2,"text":"信じられるものを探す もう見失わないから","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"3","start":21.73,"end":24.73,"text":"どうして嘘をついてしまったの","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"4","start":26.27,"end":29.27,"text":"どうして本当を話せないんだろう","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"5","start":31.56,"end":34.56,"text":"あなたはどんな顔するでしょう","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"6","start":35.96,"end":38.96,"text":"自分を守りたいだけじゃないの？","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"7","start":40.91,"end":43.91,"text":"望まない事ばかりだ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"8","start":44.94,"end":47.94,"text":"悲しそうな顔させてしまうわ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"9","start":50.42,"end":53.42,"text":"月の裏側も知らずに","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"10","start":55.37,"end":58.37,"text":"夢だけ見ていたね","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"11","start":59.81,"end":62.81,"text":"騙し愛の嘘の中で","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"12","start":65.05,"end":68.05,"text":"信じられる物を探す 瞳が欲しい","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"13","start":69.68,"end":72.68,"text":"まだ未来はわからないままだけど","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"14","start":76.13,"end":79.13,"text":"心、裏切らないで もう見失わないから","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"15","start":87.78999999999999,"end":90.78999999999999,"text":"どうして嘘を覚えたんだろう","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"16","start":92.35,"end":95.35,"text":"どうして本当を隠すのだろう","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"17","start":97.66,"end":100.66,"text":"私は知らぬふりをするのでしょう","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"18","start":102.00999999999999,"end":105.00999999999999,"text":"触れてしまうことが怖くなったの","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"19","start":107.08,"end":110.08,"text":"青いままで熟れた果実みたいに","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"20","start":112.97,"end":115.97,"text":"気付かれもしないで","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"21","start":116.69,"end":119.69,"text":"枯れてしまう前に","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"22","start":119.81,"end":122.81,"text":"一口齧って欲しいだけ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"23","start":125.9,"end":128.9,"text":"騙し愛の闇の中で","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"24","start":131.22,"end":134.22,"text":"触れたはずのぬくもりだけ 覚えている","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"25","start":135.79,"end":138.79,"text":"まだ未来はわからないままだけど","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"26","start":142.27,"end":145.27,"text":"心、裏切らないで 私を生きてくから","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"27","start":152.12,"end":155.12,"text":"藻掻くほど迷い込み","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"28","start":156.94,"end":159.94,"text":"真実は零れてく","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"29","start":161.85,"end":164.85,"text":"手に触れた感触を","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"30","start":166.7,"end":169.7,"text":"覚えていられるか","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"31","start":173.71,"end":176.71,"text":"騙し合いのこの世界で","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"32","start":178.94,"end":181.94,"text":"信じられる物を透かす 瞳が欲しい","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"33","start":183.5,"end":186.5,"text":"まだ未来は何も決まっちゃいないよ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"34","start":189.94,"end":192.94,"text":"心、裏切らないで 手探りでいいよ 私を象ろう","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"35","start":198.42000000000002,"end":201.42000000000002,"text":"いつか必ず出会うだろう同じ痛みを","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"36","start":203.37,"end":206.37,"text":"分け合えるような貴方と出会うために","translation":"","kind":"lyric"}],"candidates":[]}